---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="TakeoutFix | Refund Policy" description="Read the Refund Policy for TakeoutFix. Learn about our 14-day money-back guarantee, eligibility criteria, and how to request a refund.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 mt-20">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tighter mb-4">Refund Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-white/60">Last updated: June 12, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12 text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
      
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. Try Before You Buy</h2>
        <p>
          At TakeoutFix, we want you to be completely satisfied with our service. Because our metadata merger runs 100% locally in your browser, we offer a generous **Free Tier** that allows you to process up to 1,000 files or 1 GB of data. We highly recommend testing TakeoutFix with a small portion of your Google Takeout archive before upgrading to a paid plan.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">2. 14-Day Money-Back Guarantee</h2>
        <p>
          If you upgrade to a paid plan (Recovery Pass, Pro, Super, or Family) and encounter a technical issue or bug that prevents the tool from successfully recovering your files, you are eligible for a full refund within **14 days** of your purchase. 
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">3. Refund Eligibility Criteria</h2>
        <p>
          To qualify for a refund, the following conditions must be met:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3 text-zinc-300">
          <li>Your purchase was made within the last 14 days.</li>
          <li>You encountered a technical defect or error in the software that our support team is unable to resolve.</li>
          <li>You have not successfully processed and downloaded your full Google Takeout archive using the active license credentials.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">4. Non-Refundable Scenarios</h2>
        <p>
          Refunds will not be issued under the following circumstances:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3 text-zinc-300">
          <li>You change your mind after successfully processing and recovering your entire Google Takeout archive.</li>
          <li>You purchase a plan without verifying compatibility on the Free tier first, for files/formats that are explicitly documented as unsupported.</li>
          <li>The request is made after 14 days from the date of purchase.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">5. How to Request a Refund</h2>
        <p>
          To request a refund, please contact us by creating a ticket in our <a href="/support" class="text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 font-bold">Support Center</a> or by emailing <strong class="text-white">support@takeoutfix.com</strong> with your purchase receipt and a brief explanation of the technical issue you encountered. Refund requests are typically processed within 3–5 business days.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
